<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1681037198"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:22.395"><div begin="14.766" end="38.576" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="14.766" end="18.496" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.766" end="15.334">断</span><span begin="15.334" end="16.003">了线</span> <span begin="16.367" end="17.535">失去的</span><span begin="17.535" end="18.496">频率</span></p><p begin="19.764" end="25.037" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.764" end="20.529">丢</span><span begin="20.529" end="21.779">掉回忆</span> <span begin="22.199" end="23.177">还是</span><span begin="23.177" end="23.953">遇</span><span begin="23.953" end="25.037">见你</span></p><p begin="26.399" end="32.537" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.399" end="27.403">忽然之</span><span begin="27.403" end="28.103">间</span> <span begin="28.524" end="30.555">人来人往</span><span begin="30.555" end="32.537">世界里</span></p><p begin="33.130" end="38.576" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.130" end="34.401">遗憾温暖</span> <span begin="34.401" end="35.578">也许只</span><span begin="35.578" end="36.740">能是</span><span begin="37.202" end="38.576">期许</span></p></div><div begin="39.731" end="56.732" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="39.731" end="46.230" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.731" end="40.684">十字路口</span> <span begin="40.684" end="42.207">向左 向右</span> <span begin="42.207" end="43.397">向你</span> <span begin="43.495" end="44.033">向</span><span begin="44.033" end="45.177">着</span><span begin="45.177" end="45.538">未</span><span begin="45.538" end="46.230">来</span></p><p begin="46.460" end="52.167" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.460" end="47.721">拼命追赶</span> <span begin="47.721" end="50.237">只怕 曾经的光</span> <span begin="50.702" end="52.167">暗淡</span></p><p begin="53.370" end="56.732" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.370" end="53.964">还是年</span><span begin="53.964" end="54.483">少</span><span begin="54.483" end="54.699">太</span><span begin="54.699" end="55.256">过</span><span begin="55.256" end="55.609">勇</span><span begin="55.609" end="56.732">敢</span></p></div><div begin="57.614" end="1:23.306" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="57.614" end="1:04.114" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.614" end="58.984">才发现</span><span begin="58.984" end="1:00.681">原来我们</span> <span begin="1:00.681" end="1:01.415">也</span><span begin="1:01.415" end="1:04.114">许没结果</span></p><p begin="1:04.389" end="1:10.887" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.389" end="1:06.061">太快 太慢</span> <span begin="1:06.061" end="1:07.302">的步伐</span> <span begin="1:07.302" end="1:08.127">太</span><span begin="1:08.127" end="1:09.179">多的</span><span begin="1:09.331" end="1:10.887">折磨</span></p><p begin="1:11.903" end="1:17.907" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.903" end="1:13.991">看不清的</span><span begin="1:13.991" end="1:15.627">未来里</span> <span begin="1:15.627" end="1:16.426">要你</span><span begin="1:16.426" end="1:17.907">有我</span></p><p begin="1:18.580" end="1:23.306" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.580" end="1:19.820">我要你</span><span begin="1:19.820" end="1:20.833">有</span><span begin="1:20.833" end="1:23.306">我</span></p></div><div begin="1:36.354" end="1:54.056" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:36.354" end="1:42.873" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.354" end="1:37.327">十字路口</span> <span begin="1:37.327" end="1:38.850">向左 向右</span> <span begin="1:38.850" end="1:40.040">向你</span> <span begin="1:40.138" end="1:40.676">向</span><span begin="1:40.676" end="1:41.820">着</span><span begin="1:41.820" end="1:42.181">未</span><span begin="1:42.181" end="1:42.873">来</span></p><p begin="1:43.150" end="1:49.624" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.150" end="1:44.387">一片黑暗</span> <span begin="1:44.387" end="1:46.533">只要能牵住</span><span begin="1:46.533" end="1:47.056">你</span><span begin="1:47.056" end="1:47.587">的</span><span begin="1:47.587" end="1:49.624">手</span></p